Third-party files in this repository keep their own licenses:

emulators/reshade-shaders/Shaders/CRT-Guest-Advanced.fx
    CRT-Guest-Advanced by guest(r), ReShade port by DevilSingh
    (https://github.com/HelelSingh/CRT-Guest-ReShade). GNU General Public License v2 or later, as stated in the
    file. Modified for this launcher: GUEST_ROTATE for vertical games, and its feedback passes changed to compile
    on ReShade 6 (marked "arcade launcher" in the file).

emulators/reshade-shaders/Shaders/ReShade.fxh
    From ReShade (https://github.com/crosire/reshade-shaders), CC0-1.0.

emulators/mame/bgfx/chains/arcade-geom.json
    A retuned copy of MAME's crt-geom-deluxe chain (shaders by cgwg and others), distributed with MAME.

The emulators themselves (MAME, Flycast, Mednafen, BigPEmu, ReShade) are not included: install.ps1 downloads the
official releases, each under its own license.
